        <span>₹1,099</span>
        <button onclick="addToCart('Decorative Lamp',1299)">Add to Cart</button>
    </div>
    <div class="item">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1616627451411-42c50a50c1e1" alt="Candle Holder">
        <h3>Candle Holder</h3>
        <p>Handcrafted decorative candle holder.</p>
